{
  "slug": "onboard",
  "name": "Onboard",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "End-to-end Claude tooling generator for existing codebases. Performs deep codebase analysis (languages, frameworks, conventions, complexity), walks you through an interactive wizard, then generates a complete suite of Claude artifacts — CLAUDE.md files, path-scoped rules, project-specific skills and agents, hook configuration, PR templates, and commit conventions. Unlike recommendation-only tools, onboard produces actual files tailored to your project's detected patterns and enforced configs. Includes drift detection via /onboard:evolve to keep tooling aligned as your codebase changes. Also serves as the generation engine for the companion forge plugin (new projects) via headless invocation.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **10 skills** and **5 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (10): `adopt` (Bring a repo's existing hand-crafted Claude tooling under onboard management — synthesizes an onboard baseline (retrofit-mode meta +…), `check` (Health check for Claude tooling setup), `evolve` (Apply accumulated tooling drift to Claude configuration), `generate` (Internal v3 generation step — turns the onboard:start v3 context (analysis + wizardAnswers + research) into Claude tooling…), `generation` (Invoked by the config-generator agent during /onboard:start and /onboard:generate to produce the Claude tooling artifacts), `research` (Internal research engine for onboard v3 — fans out read-only specialists per dimension, adversarially verifies their claims, synthesizes…), `start` (Use ONLY when the user explicitly runs /onboard:start), `update` (Update existing Claude tooling against latest best practices — re-analyzes the codebase, fetches current Claude Code documentation, presents…), and 2 more\n- **Agents** (5): `codebase-analyzer` (Performs deep, read-only analysis of a software project and produces a structured report with stack detection, file inventories,…), `config-generator` (Generates all Claude Code tooling artifacts (CLAUDE.md, rules, skills, agents, hooks, MCP, output styles, snapshots, telemetry) from a…), `feature-evaluator` (Independently verifies features in a running application against the verification steps in docs/feature-list.json), `research-specialist` (Parameterized read-only deep-diver for ONE research dimension over a scoped subtree), `research-verifier` (Adversarial skeptic for the onboard:research VERIFY stage — takes the union of specialist claims and tries to REFUTE…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install onboard@claude-community` from `ApurvBazari/claude-plugins` (`onboard`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 10,
    "agent": 5
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Apurv Bazari"
  },
